{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15222010","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15222010","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1522201001:0":{"text":"어이, 다들 줄 서있는 거 안 보여? 뒤로 가!","source_cn":"喂，没看到大家都在排队吗？到后面去！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xECA83D6C4A723FDE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1522201002:0":{"text":"줄 설 시간 없어. 난 바쁘다고.","source_cn":"我赶时间，没空排队。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE42B131855173FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1522201003:0":{"text":"...이건 모두의 목숨이 걸린 구호 식량이야. 돈도 많은 게 이건 왜 받아가?","source_cn":"……这是赈灾粮，是救命的粮食！你们有钱人凭什么来领？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D44CFA99B975DDD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1522201004:0":{"text":"흥, 보칼리스에 안 힘든 사람이 있나?","source_cn":"哼，呼临城里谁没受灾啊？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF1B08E4ECA87E2B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1522201005:0":{"text":"구호 식량이면 다 같이 나눠야지. 왜 너희만 독차지하려고 해?","source_cn":"既然是赈灾粮，那就人人有份。凭什么让你们独占？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D8BE4C8F1A8CBC2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1522201006:0":{"text":"말 같지도 않은 소리! 여기 구호 식량을 기다리는 사람이 얼마나 많은지 안 보여?","source_cn":"什么歪理！你没看见，这么多人都等着这口救命的粮食吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEFE115ADC85FFFC5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1522201007:1":{"text":"그만 싸우고 줄 서!","source_cn":"别吵了！都去排队！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x92167700B5FBA192","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1522201008:1":{"text":"아까 저 자식이 뻔뻔하게 새치기할 때는 왜 아무 말도 안 하고? 맨 끝으로 보내!","source_cn":"他刚才大摇大摆插队的时候你怎么不说？你让他排到最后去！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2D0F1AB1125A020","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1522201009:0":{"text":"무능한 칼리안이 또 일을 쳤군. 이런 사소한 일도 제대로 처리하지 못하다니!","source_cn":"又是卡利安那个没用的家伙，连这点破事都管不住！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC986A2641571502","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1522201010:0":{"text":"거기! 그만 싸워라!","source_cn":"你们几个——别再吵了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8561955C9D94BF34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1522201011:0":{"text":"오호, 싸움 구경인가.","source_cn":"喔，有热闹看……","status":"matc